data chain_re_derivation: DesignRuling = DesignRuling {
  reference: decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.design_ruling", decl_name: "chain_re_derivation"),
  decided: "2026-09-15",
  governs: decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.design_argument", decl_name: "earliest_unjustified_boundary"),
  provenance: "Operator ruling, stated separately because the opposite is the default habit. Specimens: #11401 (resolve rebuilt corpus-wide state per module; repaired upstream with one shared ResolutionContext per native ingest in v2.compiler.compile), #11422 (every ordered Choice is owed one prepared plan, so per-token dispatch was the wrong link, not a slow one), #11444 (the emitter tail-call lowering is_tco_identity_passthrough was itself the earliest unjustified boundary, so the local repair was right).",
}

data root_generalization_closes_breadth: DesignRuling = DesignRuling {
  reference: decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.design_ruling", decl_name: "root_generalization_closes_breadth"),
  decided: "2026-10-16",
  governs: decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.design_argument", decl_name: "root_generalization"),
  provenance: "Operator ruling, amended 2026-10-16 after side-chat review: the method is named root generalization, with anti-unification (Plotkin) as its formal core, and lives in 6b beside chain re-derivation rather than in its own section. Root-cause repair fixes depth; this closes breadth. A new case that needs new code is first asked whether it is another instance of what existing leaves already do; if so, every leaf of that shape is collected, generalized to the least general rule at the earliest unjustified boundary (6b), and deleted (3, delete-first), repeating while the generalizations form a family. The horizontal half was filed as a_rule_is_applied_at_the_site_that_prompted_it_and_not_its_sibling with a recognition rule addressed to authors, which did not work: three fork families grew in one week while it existed (type-alias identity at node_type_compatible call sites, #13941 #14069 #13974 #14043 #14057; v1 Rust trait-bound pipelines, #13978 #14010 #14020; qualified-call resolution, #13925 #14085 #14089); positive specimens #14151 #14193 #13872 #14187). So the check is placed on the reviewer: a repeated pattern is rejected until the author answers with a stated reason not to generalize or a named trigger and follow-up, and the reviewer accepts or rejects that answer; no answer is a reject.",
}

data planning_is_one_source_for_every_repo: DesignRuling = DesignRuling {
  reference: decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.design_ruling", decl_name: "planning_is_one_source_for_every_repo"),
  decided: "2026-11-08",
  governs: decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.design_argument", decl_name: "planning_has_one_home"),
  provenance: "Operator, 2026-11-08, on the planning rework: \"there needs to be a single source for all planning and all repos\"; the daily workspace and the repository \"should be the same plan ... the daily workspace should be downstream of the repo\"; \"we have to support quick merges to main that are planning only ... instant planning changes that don't need to wait 90 minutes\"; regeneration should \"skip if the PR doesn't touch any regenerable stuff ... correctly and not just like as a hack\"; and plans \"have no real deletion triggers right now -- so it endlessly accumulates -- we should basically ruthlessly delete until only things that are relevant are left\". Confirmed 2026-11-10 when the operator asked that the policy be stated in DESIGN.md and that everyone be on the same page.",
}

data continuous_generalization_is_two_sided: DesignRuling = DesignRuling {
  reference: decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.design_ruling", decl_name: "continuous_generalization_is_two_sided"),
  decided: "2026-11-02",
  governs: decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.design_argument", decl_name: "continuous_generalization"),
  provenance: "Operator ruling, 2026-11-02: use cases begin specific, and the repository rather than the operator carries the pressure to integrate them over time. Reconciliation is two-sided: neither the incumbent nor the newcomer has authority because it arrived first or is the current task. A change may leave integration unfinished, but a material concern it identifies stays discoverable with an explicit disposition, survives the session that found it, and is revisited by bounded periodic integration work. The operator scoped the first deliverable to an honestly scoped integration record and reading path, with automatic briefing, periodic scheduling and ownership handoff reported as unconnected until their routes exist; conformance stays three-valued.",
}

